{"html":"<h3>Applicable Proof Methods: <span class=\"hl_comment\">Goals sorted according to the &#39;smart&#39; heuristic (loop breakers delayed)</span></h3><br/>\n<div class=\"preformatted methods\">1. <a class=\"internal-link proof-method\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/main/method/debug/1/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">solve(</span> Key( ~sk ) ▶₁ #i <span class=\"hl_keyword\">)</span></a> <span class=\"hl_comment\">// nr. 3 (from rule TWO)</span><br/>\n<br/>\n2. <a class=\"internal-link proof-method\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/main/method/debug/2/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">solve(</span> !KU( revealSign(x, ~sk) ) <span class=\"hl_operator\">@</span> #vk <span class=\"hl_keyword\">)</span></a> <span class=\"hl_comment\">// nr. 4</span></div><br/>\na. <a class=\"internal-link autoprove\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/autoprove/idfs/0/False/proof/debug/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">autoprove</span></a> (A. <a class=\"internal-link characterization\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/autoprove/characterize/0/False/proof/debug/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">for all solutions</span></a>)<br/>\nb. <a class=\"internal-link bounded-autoprove\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/autoprove/idfs/5/False/proof/debug/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">autoprove</span></a> (B. <a class=\"internal-link bounded-characterization\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/autoprove/characterize/5/False/proof/debug/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">for all solutions</span></a>)  with proof-depth bound 5<br/>\ns. <a class=\"internal-link autoprove-all\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/autoproveAll/idfs/0/proof/debug/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">autoprove</span></a> (S. <a class=\"internal-link characterization-all\" href=\"/thy/trace/2/autoproveAll/characterize/0/proof/debug/_\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">for all solutions</span></a>)  for all lemmas <br/>\n<br/>\n<h3>Constraint system</h3><br/>\n<dynamic-graph graphSrc=\"/thy/trace/2/intdot/proof/debug/_\"></dynamic-graph><br/>\n<div class=\"preformatted sequent\"><span class=\"hl_keyword\">last</span>: none<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">formulas</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">subterms</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">equations</span>:<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hl_keyword\">subst</span>:<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hl_keyword\">conj</span>:<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">lemmas</span>: <span class=\"hl_operator\">∀</span> x y #i<span class=\"hl_operator\">.</span> <span class=\"hl_operator\">(</span>Equality( x, y ) <span class=\"hl_operator\">@</span> #i<span class=\"hl_operator\">)</span> <span class=\"hl_operator\">⇒</span> x <span class=\"hl_operator\">=</span> y<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">allowed cases</span>: refined<br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">solved formulas</span>:<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;true <span class=\"hl_operator\">=</span> true<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"hl_operator\">∃</span> #i<span class=\"hl_operator\">.</span> <span class=\"hl_operator\">(</span>A( ) <span class=\"hl_operator\">@</span> #i<span class=\"hl_operator\">)</span><br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">unsolved constraints</span>:<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;!KU( revealSign(x, ~sk) ) <span class=\"hl_operator\">@</span> #vk <span class=\"hl_comment\">// nr: 4&quot; (useful2)&quot;</span><br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;Key( ~sk ) ▶₁ #i <span class=\"hl_comment\">// nr: 3 (from rule TWO)&quot; (useful2)&quot;</span><br/>\n<br/>\n<span class=\"hl_keyword\">solved constraints</span>:<br/>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;A( ) <span class=\"hl_operator\">@</span> #i <span class=\"hl_comment\">// nr: 0 (from rule TWO)&quot; (useful2)&quot;</span></div><br/>\n<h3>1 sub-case(s)</h3><br/>\n<h4>Case ONE</h4><br/>\n<static-graph graphSrc=\"/thy/trace/2/intdot/proof/debug/_/ONE\"></static-graph><br/>\n","title":"Method: <span class=\"hl_keyword\">solve(</span> Key( ~sk ) ▶₁ #i <span class=\"hl_keyword\">)</span><br/>\n"}